		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\NY\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\K\N \L\S\G\A\INote:\L\S\K\N

0 = Compressor ON
1-19, 25 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
(\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system switched on, all requirements met;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
(\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOverpressure\L\S\K\I - coolant pressure too high: p \L\S\K\N&gt;\L\S\K\I 32 bar;\L\S\K\A
2\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower\L\S\K\I - Blower faulty and actual voltage &lt; 3 V;\L\S\K\A
3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVacuum\L\S\K\I - Refrigerant pressure too low, thresholds dependent on the outside temperature,
Outside temperature p \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 2 bar;\L\S\K\A\I
5 \L\S\K\I- Engine start detection\L\S\K\A
6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - ECON mode \L\S\K\N(A/C function not activated)\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C system OFF\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutside temperature\L\S\K\I - Outside temperature too low, outside temperature \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 3.0 °C;\L\S\K\A
9\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower off\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IUndervoltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle system voltage too low, U (term. 15) &lt; 10.1 V;\L\S\K\A
11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine temperature indicator lamp off\L\S\K\I - Engine temperature &gt; 118 °C;\L\S\K\A
12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ISwitch off engine control module\L\S\K\I - Reason, e.g. engine temperature, radiator fan control module, kick-down (info via CAN);\L\S\K\A
13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOvervoltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle system voltage too high, U (term. 15) &gt; 17 V;\L\S\K\A
14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature, icing danger\L\S\K\I - Evaporator temperature too low;\L\S\K\A
16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor actuation\L\S\K\I - Fault in activation path, e.g. open circuit/ short-circuit B+;\L\S\K\A
17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no or implausible signal from pressure sensor (PWM signal);\L\S\K\A
18 - \L\B\K\ISpeed shut-off;\L\S\K\A
19\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IShut-off via vehicle electrical system control module\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
5 \L\S\K\N-\L\B\K\N \L\B\K\ICompressor of due to start/stop</Meldungstext>
